@cc [owner:spolu,notify:spolu,label:security] dfs-tenant-isolation
Tenant data and metadata MUST be isolated. A tenant MUST NOT be allowed to read or modify another
tenant state.

@cc [owner:pmilliotte,label:coding] no-magic-numbers
Meaningful numbers (limits, sizes, timeouts, deadlines) MUST be named module-level `const`s with
their unit in the name or type, derived from any constant they depend on. Exempt: `0`/`1` as
indexes or offsets, and test fixture data.
